      value: 'Little Ursa: ...'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1142803282351216157, guid: 77016912567e8a341a90e9df94dbc2a9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[6].Text
      value: 'Aries: Wait! Don''t tell me... You''re one of them bear guides, huh?'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1142803282351216157, guid: 77016912567e8a341a90e9df94dbc2a9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[7].Text
      value: 'Little Ursa: I''m supposed to be, but... I''m a bit lost...'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1142803282351216157, guid: 77016912567e8a341a90e9df94dbc2a9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[8].Text
      value: 'Aries: How can a guide be lost?'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1142803282351216157, guid: 77016912567e8a341a90e9df94dbc2a9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[9].Text
      value: 'Little Ursa: You said it yourself, I''m only little...'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1142803282351216157, guid: 77016912567e8a341a90e9df94dbc2a9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[10].Text
      value: 'Aries: You were big enough to help me, weren''t you?'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1142803282351216157, guid: 77016912567e8a341a90e9df94dbc2a9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[11].Text
      value: 'Little Ursa: I guess...'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1142803282351216157, guid: 77016912567e8a341a90e9df94dbc2a9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[12].Text
      value: 'Aries: Anyways, where are you going?'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1142803282351216157, guid: 77016912567e8a341a90e9df94dbc2a9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[13].Text
      value: 'Little Ursa: I''m looking for my mum - Ursa. Have you seen her?'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1142803282351216157, guid: 77016912567e8a341a90e9df94dbc2a9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[14].Text
      value: 'Aries: Oh, Ursa! Yeah, totally! I think she went...'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1142803282351216157, guid: 77016912567e8a341a90e9df94dbc2a9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[15].Text
      value: 'Aries: Actually I don''t know.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1142803282351216157, guid: 77016912567e8a341a90e9df94dbc2a9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[16].Text
      value: 'Aries: But she''s not in this cave, that''s for sure. So try looking
        out there!'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1142803282351216157, guid: 77016912567e8a341a90e9df94dbc2a9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[17].Text
      value: 'Little Ursa: Uh...'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1142803282351216157, guid: 77016912567e8a341a90e9df94dbc2a9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[18].Text
      value: 'Aries: What, you can''t smash that rock?'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1142803282351216157, guid: 77016912567e8a341a90e9df94dbc2a9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[19].Text
      value: 'Little Ursa: I''m only little!'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1142803282351216157, guid: 77016912567e8a341a90e9df94dbc2a9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[20].Text
      value: 'Aries: Little-shmittle!'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1142803282351216157, guid: 77016912567e8a341a90e9df94dbc2a9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[21].Text
      value: 'Aries: I told you, it doesn''t matter! You''re a guide bear, you must
        be stronger than you think!'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1142803282351216157, guid: 77016912567e8a341a90e9df94dbc2a9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[22].Text
      value: 'Little Ursa: ...'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1142803282351216157, guid: 77016912567e8a341a90e9df94dbc2a9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[23].Text
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1142803282351216157, guid: 77016912567e8a341a90e9df94dbc2a9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[24].Text
      value: 'Aries: Told ya!'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1142803282351216157, guid: 77016912567e8a341a90e9df94dbc2a9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[25].Text
      value: 'Little Ursa: I didn''t know I could do that...'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1142803282351216157, guid: 77016912567e8a341a90e9df94dbc2a9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[26].Text
      value: 'Aries: And you never will if you don''t try. That''s what being strong
        is about!'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1142803282351216157, guid: 77016912567e8a341a90e9df94dbc2a9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[27].Text
      value: 'Little Ursa: I''d better go. Thank you.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1142803282351216157, guid: 77016912567e8a341a90e9df94dbc2a9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[28].Text
      value: 'Aries: Good luck, Little Ursa!'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1142803282351216157, guid: 77016912567e8a341a90e9df94dbc2a9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[29].Text
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
